Input: {"question": "Who is the artist of the album \"Country Life\"?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d00", "start": 0, "end": 135, "text": "Country Life (Roxy Music album) Country Life is the fourth album by the English rock band Roxy Music, released in 1974 and reaching No."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d00", "start": 136, "end": 155, "text": "3 in the UK charts."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d00", "start": 156, "end": 172, "text": "It also made No."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d00", "start": 173, "end": 243, "text": "37 in the United States, their first record to crack the Top 40 there."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d00", "start": 244, "end": 341, "text": "The album is considered by many critics to be among the band's most sophisticated and consistent."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d00", "start": 342, "end": 483, "text": "Jim Miller in his review for \"Rolling Stone\" wrote \"\"Stranded\" and \"Country Life\" together mark the zenith of contemporary British art rock.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d00", "start": 484, "end": 581, "text": "Band leader Bryan Ferry took the album's title from the British rural lifestyle magazine \"Country"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d01", "start": 0, "end": 121, "text": "Country Life (Show of Hands album) Country Life is the eleventh studio album by English acoustic roots duo Show of Hands."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d01", "start": 122, "end": 318, "text": "Released in 2003, it marks a departure for the band, with stronger socially and politically lyrics than the duo's previous albums, as well as showcasing the duo exploring a larger musical palette."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d01", "start": 319, "end": 503, "text": "Some of the album's lyrics concern rural issues which Knightley had taken to heart in previous years, including in the aftermath of their previous lyrical album \"Cold Frontier\" (2001)."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d01", "start": 504, "end": 604, "text": "Prior to the release of \"Country Life\", the duo had released an instrumental album named \"The Path\"."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d01", "start": 605, "end": 609, "text": "Both"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d02", "start": 0, "end": 612, "text": "of contents Country Life ( Show of Hands album ) Add languages Add links Article Talk English Read Edit View history Tools Tools move to sidebar hide Actions Read Edit View history General What links here Related changes Upload file Permanent link Page information Cite this page Get shortened URL Download QR code Print/export Download as PDF Printable version In other projects Wikidata item Appearance move to sidebar hide From Wikipedia , the free encyclopedia 2003 studio album by Show of Hands Country Life Studio album by Show of Hands Released 20 October 2003 Recorded Early 2003 Studio Riverside Studios"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d03", "start": 0, "end": 44, "text": "Archived from the original on 4 March 2016 ."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d03", "start": 45, "end": 74, "text": "Retrieved 22 September 2015 ."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d03", "start": 75, "end": 117, "text": "^ a b c d e f g h i j k l m Brace , Jane ."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0202-77fd3b8929be:d03", "start": 118, "end": 165, "text": "`` Show Of Hands - Country Life '' ( review ) ."}, "D4S5": {"document_nu